---
// CollectionCenters.astro - Centros de Acopio Aliados y Puntos Físicos
---

<section
  id="centros-acopio"
  class="w-full py-12 md:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto scroll-mt-24 rounded-3xl"
  style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75) 0%, transparent 75%), url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=\'64\' height=\'64\' viewBox=\'0 0 64 64\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cpath d=\'M0 32h64M32 0v64\' stroke=\'%23C8BBAA\' stroke-width=\'0.75\' stroke-opacity=\'0.12\' stroke-dasharray=\'2 4\' fill=\'none\'/%3E%3Ccircle cx=\'32\' cy=\'32\' r=\'8\' stroke=\'%23C8BBAA\' stroke-width=\'0.5\' stroke-opacity=\'0.10\' fill=\'none\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E');"
>
  <!-- Encabezado independiente en tono vinotinto institucional #6E1F1C -->
  <div class="w-full rounded-3xl overflow-hidden mb-8 shadow-md bg-primary-dark text-white p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 border border-neutral-border/40">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="max-w-xl text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white font-bold text-xs mb-3 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">pin_drop</span>
          <span>Puntos físicos</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Encuentra un centro de acopio cerca de ti
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/80 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-left md:text-right">
        Establecimientos amigos donde puedes entregar tus donaciones en especie en sus horarios habituales. Cada aliado cuenta con un espacio reservado para recibir tu ayuda.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Grid de 5 centros de acopio + Banner de mapa interactivo -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <!-- 1. Menta Sweet Studio -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 mb-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] border border-neutral-border/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-text-main/50 p-1 text-center group" title="Espacio para logo de Menta Sweet Studio">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px] text-accent-warm">storefront</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-text-main/60 uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mt-0.5">Logo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#E5DEC9] text-text-main text-[11px] font-bold truncate">Redondel Masferrer</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-accent-warm shrink-0">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-warm"></span>
                <span>Mar – Sáb</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark leading-snug truncate">Menta Sweet Studio</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-3 leading-snug">
          Prolongación del Paseo General Escalón y 105 av. Sur, Centro Comercial 105, local 202, San Salvador.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3] px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-text-main/80 text-xs mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-border/30">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-text-main/60">schedule</span>
          <span>10:30 a. m. – 6:30 p. m.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
        <a
          href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Centro+Comercial+105+San+Salvador"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">map</span>
          <span>Google Maps</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://waze.com/ul?q=Centro+Comercial+105+San+Salvador"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">navigation</span>
          <span>Waze</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Mokafe Cannoli -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 mb-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] border border-neutral-border/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-text-main/50 p-1 text-center group" title="Espacio para logo de Mokafe Cannoli">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px] text-accent-warm">local_cafe</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-text-main/60 uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mt-0.5">Logo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#E5DEC9] text-text-main text-[11px] font-bold truncate">San Benito</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-accent-warm shrink-0">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-warm"></span>
                <span>Lun – Dom</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark leading-snug truncate">Mokafe Cannoli</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-3 leading-snug">
          C.C. Olivos Plaza, boulevard El Hipódromo, local 4, Avenida La Capilla 705, San Salvador.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3] px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-text-main/80 text-xs mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-border/30">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-text-main/60">schedule</span>
          <span>8:00 a. m. – 10:00 p. m.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
        <a
          href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Olivos+Plaza+Boulevard+El+Hipodromo+San+Salvador"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">map</span>
          <span>Google Maps</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://waze.com/ul?q=Olivos+Plaza+San+Salvador"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">navigation</span>
          <span>Waze</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Animal Therapy -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 mb-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] border border-neutral-border/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-text-main/50 p-1 text-center group" title="Espacio para logo de Animal Therapy">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px] text-accent-warm">pets</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-text-main/60 uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mt-0.5">Logo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#E5DEC9] text-text-main text-[11px] font-bold truncate">Av. Bernal</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-accent-warm shrink-0">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-warm"></span>
                <span>Lun, Mar, Jue, Vie, Sáb</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark leading-snug truncate">Animal Therapy</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-3 leading-snug">
          Plaza Alcalá, Av. Bernal 201, San Salvador.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3] px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-text-main/80 text-xs mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-border/30">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-text-main/60">schedule</span>
          <span>9:00 a. m. – 1:00 p. m.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
        <a
          href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Plaza+Alcala+Avenida+Bernal+San+Salvador"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">map</span>
          <span>Google Maps</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://waze.com/ul?q=Plaza+Alcala+San+Salvador"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">navigation</span>
          <span>Waze</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. Nails by Abby -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 mb-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] border border-neutral-border/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-text-main/50 p-1 text-center group" title="Espacio para logo de Nails by Abby">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px] text-accent-warm">spa</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-text-main/60 uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mt-0.5">Logo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#E5DEC9] text-text-main text-[11px] font-bold truncate">Santa Tecla</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-accent-warm shrink-0">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-warm"></span>
                <span>Lun – Sáb</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark leading-snug truncate">Nails by Abby</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-1 leading-snug">
          Colonia Utila, final 14 calle oriente, casa 4, Santa Tecla.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-primary-cta font-bold mb-3 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">phone</span>
          <a href="tel:+50378449676" class="hover:underline">+503 7844 9676</a>
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3] px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-text-main/80 text-xs mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-border/30">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-text-main/60">schedule</span>
          <span>8:00 a. m. – 6:00 p. m.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
        <a
          href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Colonia+Utila+Santa+Tecla"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">map</span>
          <span>Google Maps</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://waze.com/ul?q=Colonia+Utila+Santa+Tecla"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">navigation</span>
          <span>Waze</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 5. Mauwi -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 mb-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] border border-neutral-border/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-text-main/50 p-1 text-center group" title="Espacio para logo de Mauwi">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px] text-accent-warm">storefront</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-text-main/60 uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mt-0.5">Logo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#E5DEC9] text-text-main text-[11px] font-bold truncate">Antiguo Cuscatlán</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-accent-warm shrink-0">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-warm"></span>
                <span>Mar – Dom</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark leading-snug truncate">Mauwi</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-3 leading-snug">
          Calle Cuscatlán Oriente 28, local 1, Antiguo Cuscatlán.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3] px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-text-main/80 text-xs mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-border/30">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-text-main/60">schedule</span>
          <span>3:00 p. m. – 8:00 p. m.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
        <a
          href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Calle+Cuscatlan+Oriente+28+Antiguo+Cuscatlan"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">map</span>
          <span>Google Maps</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://waze.com/ul?q=Calle+Cuscatlan+Oriente+28+Antiguo+Cuscatlan"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border border-neutral-border/40 transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">navigation</span>
          <span>Waze</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 6. Banner Mapa Interactivo Próximamente -->
    <div class="bg-[#E5DEC9]/70 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-neutral-border/50 flex flex-col justify-between items-center text-center">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-dark mt-1">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">explore</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-primary-dark mt-2">Mapa Interactivo</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-main/75 mt-1 max-w-xs">
          Próximamente compartiremos un mapa interactivo para localizar con mayor facilidad cada punto de acopio.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-card-bg text-text-main/70 text-xs font-semibold mb-1 border border-neutral-border/30">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">update</span>
        <span>En desarrollo</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
